<title>CANADA: Ivaco sells plant to Birmingham.</title>
<headline>Ivaco sells plant to Birmingham.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivaco Inc said on Tuesday that it completed the sale of its Atlantic Steel steelmaking plant in Cartersville, Georgia to a newly created venture with Birmingham Steel Corp.</p>
<p>Total proceeds from the transaction were C$127 million, involving C$100 million cash and $27 million represented by a 15 percent interest in the new venture. Birmingham Steel will own the other 85 percent of the venture.</p>
<p>Ivaco would use the proceeds to reduce debt and meet other obligations, the company said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
